{"ID":"20240314092116-qbn2uij","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092116-qbn2uij","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092116-qbn2uij\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161917-p0abkds\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161917-mp5yc3i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422161917-mp5yc3i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:150,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:150\u0026#125;","title":"【厚朴三物汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422161917"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422161917-p0abkds","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422161917-p0abkds","updated":"20240422161917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痛而闭者，厚朴三物汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161917-thwc6ce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161917-thwc6ce","updated":"20240422161917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴三物汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161917-ir21cc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161917-ir21cc4","updated":"20240422161917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴八两，大黄四两，枳实五枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161917-xubaevl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161917-xubaevl","updated":"20240422161917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味以水一斗二升，先煮二味取五升，内大黄煮取三升，温服一程式。以利为度。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422161917-hthaxkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161917-hthaxkv","updated":"20240422161917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来呢，诸位继续看，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"痛而闭者，厚朴三物汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161917-f14dx6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161917-f14dx6r","updated":"20240422161917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厚朴、大黄、枳实，哎，老师，这个不是小承气汤吗？怎么这里又来个厚朴三物汤？有什么差异，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这两个汤有什么差异?最简单的区分方式，小承气汤呢是闭而不痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肚子不痛。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴三物汤，是大便不出来而痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肚子痛。就是因为它有痛，所以我们会重用厚朴，大黄四，枳实五枚。比如说，我们厚朴 4 钱，大黄 2 钱，枳实 3 钱，大黄的量是最少的，当你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把厚朴枳实加重的时候，这就是厚朴三物汤，就不是小承气汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161917-va1ygqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161917-va1ygqm","updated":"20240422161917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小承气汤的时候，处方是这样子：厚朴 2 钱，枳实 2 钱，如果遇到便秘比较严重，几天没大便啊，一个礼拜没大便啊，5 钱，5 天没大便，4 钱，三天没大便，3 钱，所以大黄的量会比厚朴枳实大些，这就是小承气汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小承气汤呢，病人便秘但是肚子不痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小承气跟大承气的区别就是有没有放屁，小承气汤呢，大肠是这样子，小肠在这边，当你的宿食堵在小肠里边的时候，大肠里边没有东西，空的，既然是空的，所以只有气排出来。所以病人不断地排很多气出来，有便秘，我们就知道小承气。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161917-u3x6edi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161917-u3x6edi","updated":"20240422161917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大承气的时候是堵到大肠里面了，连屁都不放一个，这就是大承气。所以大承气汤小承气汤区分呢就是有没有放屁，我们就可以知道。小承气汤跟厚朴三物汤就是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"厚朴三物汤是痛而闭者，因为它非常痛，厚朴能够宽肠，枳实呢，能够去心包膜的湿，心包在上面，跟三焦是表里，所以当你用枳实下去，心包的湿下来的时候，这个津液就会慢慢进入小肠里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以开药要选用枳实和厚朴来做。所以我们说，心跟小肠是什么样？相表里的。有没有，心脏，所以在胸痹脉证治篇里面，我们可以看到它用枳实它把心包膜的湿去掉，湿就会回到小肠。厚朴能够宽肠，这个时候大黄，大黄没有什么寒热呀，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄的目的只是两个字：去实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为有实症在里面，有东西堵在里面，所以我们用大黄把它排掉，不分寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240422161917-mp5yc3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422161917-mp5yc3i","updated":"20240422161917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个呢，先煮厚朴跟枳实，再去煮大黄。就是厚朴跟枳实的药物力量会很多在里边，这个时候吃厚朴三物汤，清出来了，大便排出来了，但是一点腹痛都没有。这是两个的差异，老师，万一我开错了，开错开在敌人身上没关系，开在岳母身上你就小心点了。更痛，还是排便时排出来了，但是更痛，有拉扯的痛，还是很痛。区分不难。好。"}]}]}